    Welcome to the AMIGA ZONE BBS!  Thank you for calling.  A few things
 before you create your account.
       1.  You MAY use an ALIAS for your name, if you do not like your
          current Alias, then leave mail to the sysop and he will change
          it for you.
       2.  Choose a password that is different from any other passwords
          you use.  DON'T use your USERNAME as your password, because
          it is EXTREMELY easy to guess.
       3.  There are no TIME LIMITS at all.  The only requirment is you
          don't hog the system.  There are also no DOWNLOAD LIMITS either,
          but don't abuse the privileges.  They can be revoked.  We welcome
          Amiga, IBM, and MAC files, but this is primarily an Amiga BBS.
       4. We have door games.  You can find them in their rooms, do a
          ;k to see the rooms.  Doors can be used from any room, the
          rooms that are of the same name are for messages you wish to
          post concerning those dirty dealings and things.  Oh, btw, the
          door rooms are anonymous so you can sign your door names to you
          posts for a little more fun.
